	(text "LEDs on the right edge (P51, P53-P59, as in ampel, shiftreg, uart_tx, bcd7seg, inreg) through a\nbuffer: it does not load the pads, and it runs from +5V, outside the current measurement.\nPush button on Mega D13 (internal pull-up); R22 protects against the bootloader driving D13."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
